    "entryLanes": "Approach striping shows ~4 lanes under the canopy (apparent 2-in / 2-out); counted from z20 overhead only.",
    "fastLaneOpportunity": "Wide canopy with 3+ total lanes and unused paved width on the approach.",
    "dockDoors": "Clear dock row on the south face of the dark-roof south section (~18-22 trailers backed in) plus docks on the west inner court; total estimated ~30. Inner-court detail partly obscured by canopies/equipment.",
    "dropArea": "Very large drop operation: ~8 rows of trailers in the west yard (~70), a ~35-trailer row south of the building, more in the NW corner.",
    "preGateStaging": "Long striped approach south of the canopy with room for several trucks before the gate; no marked stalls.",
    "truckGateCount": "South canopy gate is the truck gate; the NE drive off the La Porte Fwy frontage road serves the employee/visitor car lots.",
    "multipleFacilities": "Single campus cluster: main plant plus a detached west warehouse and sheds; the container laydown further west appears to be a different business and was excluded."
